{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26128","headline":"和太原张相公山亭怀古 · 高铢","name":"和太原张相公山亭怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鬬石类岩巘，飞流泻潺湲。\n远壑檐宇际，孤峦雉堞间。\n何必到海岳，境幽机自闲。\n兹焉得高趣，高步谢东山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高铢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}